 satisfaction. These results indicate that the\nbenchmark-level comparative conclusions are robust to answer-order\nrandomization. \n\n Metric \n Spearman ρ \\rho \n Top-3 Overlap \n\n Overall Semantic Satisfaction \n 0.979 \n 3/3 \n\n Event Semantic Satisfaction \n 0.937 \n 3/3 \n\n Attribute Semantic Satisfaction \n 0.993", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
