l number of matched units is m = m w + m c m=m_{w}+m_{c} . Let N r N_{r} denote the total number of word and character units in the reference text. We define mixed-unit coverage as \n\n R mixed = m N r . R_{\\mathrm{mixed}}=\\frac{m}{N_{r}}. \n\n (10) \n\n Clipped-count mat\n\n=== GitHub (pos 106) ===\nGitHub Issue \n × \n\n Title: \n\n Content selection saved. Describe the issue below: \n\n Description: \n\n Submit without GitHub \n Submit in GitHub \n\n arXiv is now an independent nonprofit! \n Learn more \n &times; \n\n Back to arXiv \n\n Why HTML? \n\n Report Issue \n\n Back to Abstract \n\n Download PDF \n\n Abstract \n Introduction \n\n Related Work \n\n Text-to-Audio Generation \n Benchmarks and Evaluation of TTA Generation. \n\n AudioScape-TTA \n\n Overview \n Structured Soundscape Benchmark \n Rubric-based Audio-grounded Evaluation \n\n Experiments \n\n Experimental Setup \n Fine-grained Semantic Evaluation \n Comparison with Conventional Evaluation Metrics \n User Study \n Human Alignment of Evaluation Metrics \n Discussion \n\n Conclusion \n References \n\n Additional Dataset Details \n\n Annotation Pipeline \n\n Complexity Score Definition \n\n Event Density. \n Structural Complexity. \n Complexity Score. \n Complementarity Analysis. \n\n Data Statistics \n\n Semantic Rubrics Construction Details", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "17cabbeb-4110-4879-b2c6-8c2ab37431f0", "uuid": "4415d545-7477-4510-b8b9-6ad164616537", "timestamp": "2026-08-06T06:20:19.702Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "=== Scope of contrastive (pos 2219) ===\nScope of contrastive negatives. \n\n License: CC BY-NC-ND 4.0\n\narXiv:2608.04479v1 [cs.SD] 05 Aug 2026 \n\n AudioScape-TTA: A Structured Soundscape Benchmark for Fine-Grained Text-to-Audio Evaluation \n\nJinting Wang 1 ,\nYuguang Yang 2 ,\nShengyu Li 1 ,\nYan Rong 1 ,\n Shan Yang 2 ,\nXiaoda Yang 3 ,\nLi Liu 1 \n\n Abstract \n Text-to-audio (TTA) generation has recently achieved remarkable progress 